## What you'll leave with

- **The fast items merged:** README status, setup placeholder, LICENSE, code of conduct, templates, and labels.
- **CONTRIBUTING and your communication norms** drafted far enough to read, merged or on an open pull request.
- **Your Stranger's Read sheet**, with what your partner couldn't find and what you're doing about it. Keep it; it's part of your submission.
- **Two or three seed issues** on your tracker, written through your own templates.

